WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:10.980
[Luffy chuckles]

3
00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Hey, you guys!

4
00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.020
Is everybody gonna be ready

5
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:17.440
for that big party after we
kick Kaido's sorry butt?

6
00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.050
[ALL]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

7
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.890
Move it! You're in my way!

8
00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.530
Huh?

9
00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.570
[gasps]
It's Jaggy!

10
00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:40.160
I already said
I got dibs on Kaido.

11
00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.910
It's personal, ain't it?

12
00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:47.830
[Killer laughs]
Yeah, sure it is.

13
00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:52.130
[Kid Pirates laughing]

14
00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.270
If I were you,
I'd go brush my hair

15
00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:02.110
and wash my face, Kaido.

16
00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:04.280
'Cause I'm taking
that head of yours

17
00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:07.510
[LAUGHS]

18
00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:07.530
and putting it on
the bow of my ship!

19
00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:07.550
[KID PIRATE A]
Yeah, he's gonna
pay for making Killer so happy!

20
00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:10.370
[KID PIRATE A]
Yeah, he's gonna
pay for making Killer so happy

21
00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:10.430
That's not cool at all!

22
00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:11.800
That's not cool at all

23
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:11.830
[KID PIRATE B]
Now we all gotta be happy

24
00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.350
[KID PIRATE B]
Now we all gotta be happy,

25
00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:13.410
so he feels at home

26
00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:15.370
so he feels at home!

27
00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:16.490
[KILLER]
No, you don't!

28
00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:17.100
at you

29
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:19.940
[Killer laughs]

30
00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:24.630
[Kid Pirates laughing]

31
00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.880
[chuckles]
See you later,
Straw Hat!

32
00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.430
If you can keep up.

33
00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:31.180
[LUFFY]
I didn't even invite you!

34
00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:33.390
Get in line, damn it!

35
00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:39.020
Least they're having fun.

36
00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:43.900
Jinbe! You know
what to do next!

37
00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:46.190
Don't let us fall
behind Jaggy's ship!

38
00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:49.910
[Jinbe laughs]
Having a race, are we?

39
00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:52.280
Sounds good! Leave it to me!

40
00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.160
I'll catch that rascal's ship

41
00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.160
and we'll beat him
to the island!

42
00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.370
Now hold on tight!

43
00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:06.340
Aw yeah! Here it comes!

44
00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:11.380
We're gonna smoke
those guys, easy!

45
00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:17.810
Better not lose to
anyone else, Kaido!

46
00:02:17.810 --> 00:02:21.480
I'm on my way! Get ready!

47
00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:56.270
[RAIZO]
Of course!

48
00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.710
[RAIZO]
Mm!

49
00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.060
[RAIZO]
Nin, nin!

50
00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.940
Prepare to dive!

51
00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:49.280
Aye, aye, Captain!

52
00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:50.950
[ALL]
Aye-aye, sir!

53
00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.590
Then we shall
meet again shortly!

54
00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.170
See you at the back entrance!

55
00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:05.600
<b>A Family Matter</b>

56
00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.840
Water intake's good!

57
00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:12.680
Sir Law! It's in
your hands! Guide us!

58
00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:15.140
[ALL]
Aye-aye, sir!

59
00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:28.820
Penguin, adjust our
trim 30 degrees!

60
00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:31.860
Adjusting trim,
30 degrees. Got it!

61
00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:37.410
[BEPO]
Sustain a depth of 100 meters!

62
00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:40.540
Captain, can you confirm
our final destination?

63
00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.790
To the rear shore of Onigashima!

64
00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:44.590
Go full speed ahead!

65
00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.750
[ALL]
– Aye-aye, sir!
– Aye-aye, sir!

66
00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:58.320
We are drawing near!
Stay sharp, everyone!

67
00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:00.490
We don't know what to
expect from here on out.

68
00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:03.280
There could be an
ambush at any instant!

69
00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:07.700
Haven't lost your touch
in all these years, I hope?

70
00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.370
Just the opposite, my friend.

71
00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:12.130
Why else would I endure
two decades of pain?

72
00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:16.210
[Kin'emon laughs]
Grim, but I'll take it!

73
00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.090
Let's put an end to this!

74
00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.030
Of

75
00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:50.100
[LUFFY]
So, this is Onigashima.

76
00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:55.360
It's bigger than I expected.

77
00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:57.150
The enemy stronghold.

78
00:05:57.150 --> 00:06:00.700
It's massive.
Kaido really lives here?

79
00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:02.780
Look, Kin. Through the screen.

80
00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:06.370
Yes. They're having a party,
just as we'd hoped.

81
00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:09.250
They aren't on the lookout
for an enemy attack at all.

82
00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:12.960
I suppose they haven't yet
received Kanjuro's report.

83
00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:14.540
Or perhaps they
have received it,

84
00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.040
but deemed it inconsequential.

85
00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:18.920
Either way, their complacency
is our blessing.

86
00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:22.260
Now, we can continue
forward with confidence.

87
00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:25.140
We shall strike before
they know what hit them!

88
00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:29.720
The castle's in
the center, right?

89
00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.190
Inside that giant skull?

90
00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:34.150
That's right. Hard to
see from here, though.

91
00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:36.190
I thought it'd be
closer to the shore,

92
00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:36.300
but we still got a ways to go.

93
00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:38.120
we got a ways to go.

94
00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.070
I don't think
they've noticed us.

95
00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:42.240
Better haul ass
while we still can.

96
00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:43.990
[sighs]

97
00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:46.960
What's that?

98
00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:49.580
They look like ships.

99
00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:50.920
Are you seein' this?

100
00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:53.250
Huh? That can't be right.

101
00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.590
I didn't hear nothing
about no boats.

102
00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.910
[USOPP]
Why don't you take a little nap?

103
00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:02.290
Special Attack. Green Star, go!

104
00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.840
[gasps]

105
00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:10.180
[Beast Pirates gasp]

106
00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:15.230
[chuckles]
That's Sleepgrass!

107
00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:21.350
Hold on. Weren't there guards
over there a moment ago?

108
00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:30.280
[Usopp laughs]
Looks like they're out cold!

109
00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.490
Wonder how that happened?

110
00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:34.120
You sleep tight now!

111
00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:37.870
[laughs]

112
00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.620
I understand the plan,

113
00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.210
but there's one thing
that's troubling me.

114
00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:44.090
Although it's reassuring that
our numbers are so great,

115
00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:44.960
[KIN'EMON]
We have arrived!

116
00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.460
we have an awful lot
of ships out here.

117
00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:49.010
If we leave them
moored this way,

118
00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:52.190
the enemy will take notice
and guess our plan.

119
00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:54.820
Everyone disembark
and ready your tools!

120
00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:58.990
[Samurai yell]

121
00:07:57.610 --> 00:07:59.020
[Luffy gasps]

122
00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:01.190
[USOPP]
Huh? What are they up to?

123
00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:02.860
Wait, don't tell me
they're gonna...

124
00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:05.400
Sink the ships!

125
00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:14.580
[BOTH]
– Wha?
– Wha?

126
00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:17.000
Is this part of the plan?
'Cause nobody told me!

127
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.460
What are they doing?
They worked hard on those!

128
00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.180
Why'd you do that?

129
00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:27.350
'Cause you were
trying to hide the ships?

130
00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:30.850
But how the heck are you
supposed to sail them home?

131
00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:32.270
What are you thinking?

132
00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:33.650
You're gonna get stuck here!

133
00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:37.070
If things go south,
there'll be no turning back!

134
00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:42.610
[KIN'EMON]
You need not concern
yourselves with us, my friends.

135
00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:47.160
We are happy to let them sink.

136
00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:51.160
We do not require
return ships for this mission.

137
00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.500
We are off, Sir Luffy.

138
00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:59.670
I pray that we meet again soon.

139
00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:01.550
Stay well.

140
00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:07.760
This is it. Keep a low profile.

141
00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:23.740
What an inspiring
sight to behold.

142
00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:27.330
Every last one of them,
utterly resolute.

143
00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.960
No room for hesitation or doubt.

144
00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:31.750
It's win or die.

145
00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.960
They are challenging an
Emperor of the Sea after all.

146
00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:38.200
Nothing less will
suffice in this battle.

147
00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:41.140
But what if they need
to escape the island?

148
00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:42.730
Then they'll all be
swallowed up by the sea.

149
00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:44.190
[Chopper, Usopp gasp]

150
00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:46.020
– Wait!
– Uh-oh.

151
00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.360
If they're sinking their ships,

152
00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:49.480
does that mean we
gotta sink the Sunny?

153
00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.400
Over my dead body!

154
00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.740
We can hide
a few ships, don't worry.

155
00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:57.080
But you should disembark.
It's time to move.

156
00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:00.620
Okey-dokey, here we go!

157
00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.790
[gasps]

158
00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:05.580
Wait, who are they?

159
00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.470
[CARROT]
Shoot! We're in trouble already!

160
00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:08.130
The coast should be clear.

161
00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:08.890
What's wrong, Carrot?
See something?

162
00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:11.140
But it isn't though!

163
00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:14.900
How did we miss them?

164
00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:18.320
There's a whole ton of enemies
waiting right at the shore!

165
00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:23.540
You see the other
end of the bridge?

166
00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:36.520
Hey! What in the hell
happened to my clothes?

167
00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:41.360
[Killer laughs]
We look like Beast Pirates now.

168
00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.640
That's my Garb-Garb
special technique.

169
00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:46.640
What's that?

170
00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:51.140
What you see before you is known
as "Kin's Clothing Company"!

171
00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:57.110
I do not know you.

172
00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:00.480
But it seems that you are
mighty pirates, indeed.

173
00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.900
I shall not dissuade
you gentlemen

174
00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:04.660
from invading this island,

175
00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:07.160
but know that the enemy
is formidable.

176
00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:10.040
Furthermore, we are outnumbered
over five-to one.

177
00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.410
So, I advise you
to take advantage

178
00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:13.660
of those disguises
I've constructed.

179
00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:16.750
[Killer laughs]
Works for me.

180
00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:18.800
We're only interested in Kaido.

181
00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:22.970
The fewer lackeys we have
to fight, the better.

182
00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:24.220
Let's go!

183
00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.430
[KILLER]
Yeah.

184
00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.430
This way, Sir Luffy!

185
00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:30.760
You and your crew should
pass through the gate as well.

186
00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:33.020
Awesome! This is gonna be fun!

187
00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:34.480
[Luffy laughs]

188
00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:40.950
[laughs]

189
00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:47.540
[CHOPPER]
Transform!

190
00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:49.750
Holy crap! Beast mode!

191
00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:52.720
Yeah.

192
00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:55.470
Wow, Chobro! Lookin' cool!

193
00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:57.640
Now it's my turn!

194
00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.810
You're a savage beauty, Nami!

195
00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:12.020
The queen of the beasts!
Maul me!

196
00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:14.490
All right, let me try!

197
00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:23.290
[chuckles]
How do I look,
Robin? Am I beastly?

198
00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.450
You look normal.

199
00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:26.710
[gasps]
The savagery!

200
00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:28.750
You're taking this
Beast thing too far.

201
00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:30.420
[SANJI]
You look like
you could rip me in half!

202
00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:32.090
In a hot way!

203
00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:37.450
However, these clothes are not
made of traditional cloth.

204
00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:49.150
So, if you take them off,
or they become damaged,

205
00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:52.030
my technique will be dispelled.

206
00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:56.490
Heed my words, men!

207
00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:56.720
We tread upon Onigashima.

208
00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.660
We tread upon Onigashima,
Kaido's stronghold!

209
00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:00.250
Kaido's stronghold!

210
00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.200
We must avoid
unnecessary fights.

211
00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:07.650
Our destination is the castle
and the final battle!

212
00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:12.860
May fortune walk beside us!

213
00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:17.910
[Orochi giggles]

214
00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:20.030
[sighs]
Yes.

215
00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:23.710
I'm finally free from the ghosts
of the accursed Kozuki Clan!

216
00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:25.500
And I must say,
in my whole life,

217
00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.670
booze never tasted so sweet!

218
00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:33.340
[Orochi laughs]

219
00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:36.470
[NARRATOR]
Orochi is feeling carefree.

220
00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:39.430
His spy, Kanjuro,
has faithfully told him

221
00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:42.680
every detail of the
Akazaya samurai's plan.

222
00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:47.020
He believes he has completely
crushed their insurrection.

223
00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:51.650
[chuckles]
Their rendezvous
point is Tokage Port!

224
00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:55.150
Destroy every last route
that leads there!

225
00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.320
<b>Great Bridge

Between

Kuri and Udon</b>

226
00:13:56.320 --> 00:13:57.860
<b>Great Bridge

Between Ringo

and Hakumai</b>

227
00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:01.450
<b>Itachi Port

Kuri</b>

228
00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.950
The Akazaya samurai
are helpless now!

229
00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.540
Time for them to die!

230
00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:13.000
[NARRATOR]
His fears dispelled,

231
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:16.340
he celebrates his
would-be victory.

232
00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:20.260
<b>Onigashima</b>

233
00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:21.580
[NARRATOR]
However,
just outside the castle...

234
00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.760
<b>The Raid Has Begun</b>

235
00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:24.540
[NARRATOR]
The raid is about to begin.

236
00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:31.100
<b>Eastern
Forces</b>

237
00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:32.210
[NARRATOR]
The Eastern Forces
are led by Kin'emon.

238
00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:39.150
<b>Southern
Forces</b>

239
00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:39.890
[NARRATOR]
The Southern Forces
are led by Denjiro.

240
00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:44.230
Combined, there are
more than 5,000 troops.

241
00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:50.040
<b>Polar Tang</b>

242
00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:54.490
[NARRATOR]
Nearby, on Law's submarine,

243
00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.380
<b>Law</b>
<b>Kaido's

Castle</b>
<b>Southern

Forces Eastern

Forces</b>

244
00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.950
the remaining Akazaya
samurai make their way

245
00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.820
to the rear of the island,
aiming for the castle,

246
00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:02.330
where Kaido and
Orochi are feasting.

247
00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:06.250
[Beast Pirates laughing]

248
00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:09.300
[NARRATOR]
As over 5,000
troops draw ever closer,

249
00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.720
the enemy remains unaware.

250
00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.720
[NAMI]
Could you hurry it up, Franky?

251
00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:17.550
What the heck are you doing
in there that's taking so long?

252
00:15:17.550 --> 00:15:19.340
Everybody else already left!

253
00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:21.310
You can't rush genius, bro.

254
00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:26.100
But don't you worry,
we'll catch up in no time.

255
00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.400
Black Rhino,

256
00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:50.300
<b>Black Rhino
FR-U4</b>

257
00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.420
[Brook laughs]

258
00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:51.680
yeah!

259
00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:56.430
I saw that thing during
the battle on Fishman Island!

260
00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.190
It's "Black Rhino," baby!

261
00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:03.810
And there's more
where that came from!

262
00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.740
<b>Brachio Tank 5</b>

263
00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:20.920
Brachio. Tank 5! You're up!

264
00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:23.000
[CHOPPER]
Tank Commander Chopper!

265
00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:22.660
<b>anderCho</b>
<b>manderChop</b>
<b>mmaopp</b>
<b>ommpe</b>
<b>Comper</b>

266
00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.540
<b>erC</b>

267
00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.540
<b>Cr</b>

268
00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:25.540
<b>andho</b>
<b>mp</b>
<b>oe</b>

269
00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.880
Reporting for duty!

270
00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.550
We're counting on you, pal!

271
00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:30.170
Look at that!
Tough armor and a free ride!

272
00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:30.630
Own it, Chobro!

273
00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:31.090
I won't let you down!

274
00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:36.630
Nice! Let me handle the cannon!

275
00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.140
[CHOPPER]
Chopper!

276
00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.350
[USOPP]
Usopp!

277
00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.350
[FRANKY]
Franky!

278
00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:45.940
<b>We're here!</b>

279
00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:45.280
– We're here!
– We're here!

280
00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:47.190
[ALL]
– We're here!
– We're here!

281
00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:48.510
What'dya say, gang?
Was that worth the wait? Huh?

282
00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:49.580
is on the line here.

283
00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.490
Hey, where did Luffy run off to?

284
00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.570
[JINBE]
About that,
he noticed Kid and his crew

285
00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.450
going up the steps and
got worried they might

286
00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.620
get in the way
of Kin'emon's plan.

287
00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:01.500
Jaggy! I'm gonna
shut your butt down!

288
00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.430
Be back later!

289
00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:03.720
Get

290
00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:04.580
Ugh. He's just gonna get in
a fight and make things worse.

291
00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.170
[ALL]
– He's just gonna get in a fight and make things worse!
– He's just gonna get in a fight and make things worse!

292
00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.170
Why'd you let him get away?

293
00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.010
Zoro said exactly what you said,
then ran off, too.

294
00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.560
[Luffy yells]

295
00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.600
He's just gonna get in a fight
and make things worse.

296
00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.050
[ZORO]
Hey, Luffy! Hold it!

297
00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:17.220
Hey, Luffy! Hold it!

298
00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.060
[ALL]
– He'll just lose his way and make things worse!
– He'll just lose his way and make things worse!

299
00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:22.390
Oh, I see.

300
00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.650
We can have fun
without those two!

301
00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.690
[Beast Pirates laughing]

302
00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:26.400
Let's go for a romantic drive

303
00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:29.860
through the battlefield,
Nami-sweet!

304
00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:33.570
[Luffy yells]

305
00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.450
[Sanji gasps]

306
00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:35.730
He can be careless.

307
00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.130
Lemme take your place!

308
00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:42.010
You don't deserve
to go to heaven!

309
00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:43.260
I dunno what to tell you, man.

310
00:17:43.260 --> 00:17:43.820
I'm the sharpshooter!

311
00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:44.600
you slap together.

312
00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:45.850
Seat's taken.

313
00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:52.320
Hey, wanna ride with me?

314
00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:55.200
Can I? I'd love to!

315
00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.500
[BROOK]
Thank you, I will!

316
00:17:57.500 --> 00:17:58.960
You're not Robin!

317
00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:03.000
Nothing wrong with
a little bromance! [laughs]

318
00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:06.550
Guess I can't argue with that.

319
00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:07.880
Hey, Commander Chopper!

320
00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:10.510
We'll dock these at
the back of the island.

321
00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:12.260
I'll meet you there!

322
00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:13.930
Stay safe, bro.

323
00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:16.060
We're gonna dock them?

324
00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:17.440
[Kawamatsu laughs]
That's reassuring to hear!

325
00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:20.100
[FRANKY]
Super!

326
00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:22.230
Roger that!

327
00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:30.620
[screams]
My goodness,
I feel like a rock star again!

328
00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.950
You're gonna spill it on me!

329
00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:38.290
Let's go, Commander!

330
00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:43.000
Oh, Robin! Ride up here with me!

331
00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.960
I think I'll pass, actually.

332
00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:48.510
The top of the tank is
going to get covered in dust.

333
00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:51.340
I suppose we'd better
start walking.

334
00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:52.550
Right.

335
00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:54.060
[Usopp yells]

336
00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:56.930
[Brook screams]

337
00:18:56.930 --> 00:19:00.100
[JINBE]
Looks like all of you
are as lively as ever.

338
00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:02.480
In a battle where
everyone is excited,

339
00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:05.650
it's crucial to have someone
with a clear perspective.

340
00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:08.110
How mature! We appreciate it.

341
00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:12.400
I'm the new recruit, after all.
I have to prove my worth.

342
00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:26.000
Come on! Don't force me
to drag you!

343
00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:29.080
[NARRATOR]
Kanjuro kidnapped
Momonosuke and escaped,

344
00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.210
but has been met with

345
00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:33.000
one obstacle after
another ever since.

346
00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:37.680
As Kin'emon had hoped,
he has yet to make it to Orochi.

347
00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:40.440
I've never been down
in the tunnels before.

348
00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:43.060
I didn't know that
they were so complex!

349
00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:45.860
The underlings still think
I'm with the enemy.

350
00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:48.820
They wouldn't believe me
if I told them the truth.

351
00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.400
It's going to be a disaster

352
00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:54.120
if those samurai make it
to the castle before me!

353
00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:57.330
One of these paths
must lead to Lord Orochi!

354
00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:00.550
[Luffy yells]

355
00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.970
Here's your oshiruko!

356
00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:06.200
[Ulti squeals]
Why Commander Kaido,

357
00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:08.830
I'm ever-ever so happy
to see you!

358
00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.790
[PAGE ONE]
Now you're
just overcompensating.

359
00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:17.380
No one has drinks.

360
00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:22.060
Yeah. I didn't want to
get drunk with the lackeys.

361
00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:25.270
I was holding out till I could
drink with you, Kaido.

362
00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:28.190
Aha. Fair enough.

363
00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:30.940
In that case, we can all
go to the hall later.

364
00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:33.350
No standing on ceremony today.

365
00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:35.850
Is there something we don't
know about going on right now?

366
00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:37.480
The plan was to
introduce you to Linlin

367
00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:38.980
before we kicked things off,

368
00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:40.960
but it seems she wants
to make me wait.

369
00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:43.420
They said she's still
getting dressed.

370
00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.130
Who knows when she'll be done.

371
00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:48.050
Anyway, Linlin's not
the issue here.

372
00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:50.260
A little "complication" came up.

373
00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:52.470
That's why I kept you waiting.

374
00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:53.850
[ULTI]
Get it together already!

375
00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:54.150
[PAGE ONE]
No snapping!

376
00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:56.450
You can complain if you like,

377
00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:58.660
but I'm not the one
who called all of you here

378
00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:00.120
in the first place.

379
00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:01.560
All right. If it wasn't you,
then who was it?

380
00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:02.860
[PAGE ONE, ULTI]
Huh?

381
00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.250
[KING]
I did.

382
00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:12.300
[KING]
Sorry for going
behind your back, Kaido.

383
00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:13.720
It was the only way.

384
00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:17.300
Shoulda known. King, this had
better be worth it.

385
00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:20.720
Yeah, King. Why the hell'd
you go and trick us?

386
00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:22.390
[KING]
Because some of you
wouldn't have come

387
00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:25.100
if you knew it was me
who summoned you.

388
00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:30.270
Namely Who's-Who and Sasaki!

389
00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:31.860
That's true.

390
00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:34.820
[KING]
You were both captains of
your own pirate crews once,

391
00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:39.080
so I'm sure you want to take our
positions as Lead Performers.

392
00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:41.950
[SASAKI]
This is a meritocracy.
What's wrong with that?

393
00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:44.370
[WHO'S-WHO]
Obviously, we're aiming high.

394
00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:46.190
[KING]
Know your place.

395
00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:48.400
Whoa! I've heard enough!

396
00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:50.820
Can't you save this
for another day?

397
00:21:50.820 --> 00:21:53.070
We're having a party!

398
00:21:53.070 --> 00:21:56.910
Well, King? Wanna tell us
why you called them?

399
00:21:56.910 --> 00:22:00.250
[KING]
Because I got tipped off
about your "little complication"

400
00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.290
and I wanted to help.

401
00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:04.960
You could use their
assistance, right?

402
00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:09.880
I suppose so. Bao Huang!

403
00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:12.090
[BAO HUANG]
Yessir!

404
00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:18.070
<b>Headliner Bao Huang

(Flying Squirrel SMILE)
Beast Pirates</b>

405
00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:26.160
What's the schedule for
the rest of the night?

406
00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:30.620
[BAO HUANG]
Master Queen
is currently performing

407
00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:32.830
on the Golden Festival Stage.

408
00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:36.920
However, once his performance
is complete,

409
00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:39.710
the three Lead Performers
and Fukurokuju

410
00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:44.510
will take to the stage
and make a toast!

411
00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:50.930
Then Lord Orochi and Commander
Kaido will give speeches!

412
00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:53.480
Next, the special
guests will arrive!

413
00:22:53.480 --> 00:22:56.440
The Big Mom Pirates reach
the island on their ship,

414
00:22:57.530 --> 00:23:00.570
and then Commander
Kaido and Big Mom

415
00:23:00.570 --> 00:23:04.900
will join together
and formally announce

416
00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:09.950
the world's strongest
pirate alliance!

417
00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:13.500
Finally, Commander
Kaido will make

418
00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:19.170
an important announcement!

419
00:23:20.260 --> 00:23:20.630
That is all.

420
00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:22.460
[ULTI]
An important announcement?

421
00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:24.800
It's not like you to
keep us hanging like that!

422
00:23:24.800 --> 00:23:26.760
It's ever-ever so annoying!

423
00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:29.140
Yeah, I know, I know.

424
00:23:29.140 --> 00:23:32.600
But it'll cause confusion
if I say it now.

425
00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:36.980
Anyway, let's talk about
that job I need you to do.

426
00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:40.440
My fool of a son, Yamato,
disappeared today.

427
00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:44.610
Go find him and
bring him back here.

428
00:23:44.610 --> 00:23:48.110
Oh my. That's not an easy task!

429
00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:49.950
Does that mean that
your mystery announcement

430
00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:53.160
has something to do with
Young Master Yamato?

431
00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:55.000
Seems you're catching on.

432
00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:56.410
[BLACK MARIA]
I see.

433
00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:58.870
[ULTI]
Making us clean up
your family issues, huh?

434
00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:00.170
[PAGE ONE]
Hey!

435
00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:03.500
Okay. So what happens
if we bring him back?

436
00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:05.170
[KAIDO]
I'll give you
the right to challenge

437
00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:08.550
the Lead Performer
of your choice.

438
00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:10.050
How's that?

439
00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:13.010
Seriously? Oh, I'll do it!

440
00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:16.350
Count me in. I got this.

441
00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:18.640
I assume you don't mind?

442
00:24:17.190 --> 00:24:18.480
No.No.

443
00:24:18.480 --> 00:24:19.900
Not at all!

444
00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:23.190
[BOTH]
No. Not at all.

445
00:24:23.190 --> 00:24:25.570
[All chuckle]

446
00:24:23.230 --> 00:24:24.690
[Ulti sighs]

447
00:24:25.570 --> 00:24:26.900
[BEAST PIRATE N]
Is that soup?

448
00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:28.780
Yeah, the chef made too much.

449
00:24:28.780 --> 00:24:30.950
[BEAST PIRATE N]
Well,
don't bring it here, stupid!

450
00:24:30.950 --> 00:24:32.030
Where should we put it?

451
00:24:32.030 --> 00:24:35.080
C'mon. Where are you?

452
00:24:35.080 --> 00:24:37.620
I bet you've never even
heard of Oden before!

453
00:24:37.620 --> 00:24:40.500
Don't you ruin this, Jaggy!

454
00:24:40.500 --> 00:24:42.920
Hey! Have you seen
a Jaggy in here?

455
00:24:42.920 --> 00:24:45.260
A what now? Is that food?

456
00:24:45.260 --> 00:24:47.220
[QUEEN]
♪ Not gonna lose no weight. ♪

457
00:24:47.220 --> 00:24:48.880
Hold on.

458
00:24:48.880 --> 00:24:52.640
♪ I got enough fans
attracted to my funk! ♪

459
00:24:52.640 --> 00:24:55.810
I didn't think I'd
run into Balloon yet!

460
00:24:55.810 --> 00:24:59.190
Just showed up?
Then grab a bite to eat!

461
00:24:59.190 --> 00:25:00.690
[BEAST PIRATE Q]
We got the goods right there!

462
00:25:00.690 --> 00:25:01.940
All right!

463
00:25:01.940 --> 00:25:03.440
[BEAST PIRATES]
Hell yeah!

464
00:25:03.440 --> 00:25:07.070
Whoa! You guys really know
how to chow down, don't ya?

465
00:25:07.070 --> 00:25:08.700
Got more coming. Help yourself!

466
00:25:08.700 --> 00:25:10.660
If you don't mind!

467
00:25:11.490 --> 00:25:13.370
[BEAST PIRATE W]
That's what
the Paradise Farm is for!

468
00:25:13.370 --> 00:25:14.860
Feeding us and us alone!

469
00:25:14.860 --> 00:25:15.160
for

470
00:25:15.160 --> 00:25:16.740
[BEAST PIRATE X]
If those rats from Okobore Town

471
00:25:16.740 --> 00:25:19.290
ate something this good,
they'd die from shock!

472
00:25:19.290 --> 00:25:20.110
[Beast Pirate Y laughs]

473
00:25:20.110 --> 00:25:21.400
Just take the soup!

474
00:25:21.400 --> 00:25:23.240
I don't want it!

475
00:25:23.240 --> 00:25:28.040
[Beast Pirates laughing]

476
00:25:23.280 --> 00:25:24.780
[Both gasp]

477
00:25:25.970 --> 00:25:28.140
[Beast Pirates gasp]

478
00:25:30.350 --> 00:25:32.980
What the hell, dude?
Why'd you bring oshiruko?

479
00:25:32.980 --> 00:25:35.560
[BEAST PIRATE AE]
We're doing
drinks and appetizers right now!

480
00:25:35.560 --> 00:25:37.400
[gasps]
Oshiruko?

481
00:25:37.400 --> 00:25:38.820
[BEAST PIRATE AF]
Don't blame me!

482
00:25:38.820 --> 00:25:40.940
They made too much,
so they're passing it off on us!

483
00:25:40.940 --> 00:25:44.030
We're drinking! You think
this pairs with alcohol?

484
00:25:44.030 --> 00:25:46.360
[BEAST PIRATE AD]
We got
plenty of better things to eat!

485
00:25:46.360 --> 00:25:47.490
Forget this crap!

486
00:25:47.490 --> 00:25:49.740
It's so sweet,
it makes my teeth ache!

487
00:25:49.740 --> 00:25:52.410
[BEAST PIRATE AF]
Why don't you
spill it over Okobore Town?

488
00:25:52.410 --> 00:25:53.700
[Beast Pirate AF laughs]

489
00:25:53.700 --> 00:25:54.960
[BEAST PIRATE AG]
They'll lick it off the ground

490
00:25:54.960 --> 00:25:57.040
and thank us for it!

491
00:26:10.260 --> 00:26:16.100
Yummy [OTAMA GIGGLING]

492
00:26:12.180 --> 00:26:15.920
Yummy!

493
00:26:15.920 --> 00:26:16.140
[OTAMA]
I had no idea
that food could taste so good!

494
00:26:16.140 --> 00:26:16.360
I had no idea that
food could taste so good

495
00:26:16.360 --> 00:26:16.600
I had no idea that
food could taste so good! [OTAMA]
I had no idea that
food could taste so good!

